==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Slavic|na|lang=sh}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|h₂neh₃|lang=sh}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/na/|lang=sh}}
* {{audio|Sr-na.ogg|audio}}

===Preposition===
{{sh-preposition|head=на|c|na|na}}

# (''with accusative'') [[to]], [[on]], [[onto]] (with change of position, answering the question {{term|sc=Cyrl|куда|ку̀да|lang=sh}})
#: ићи на концерт — to go to a concert
#: ставити књигу на сто(л) — to put a book on the table
# (''with locative'') [[on]], [[at]], [[in]] (without change of position, answering the question {{term|sc=Cyrl|гдје|гдје̏|lang=sh}}/{{term|sc=Cyrl|где|где̏|lang=sh}})
#: књига је на столу — the book is on the table
#: бити на концерту — to be at the concert
#: бити на улици — to be in the street
# (''with accusative'') [[by]], [[for]], [[at]] (in expressions with time)
#: отићи некуда на пар дана — to go somewhere for a couple of days
#: на љето — next summer, the following summer
#: на вр(иј)еме — on time
#: бити плаћен на сат — to be payed by the hour
# (''with accusative'') to indicate a source of power or energy
#: подморница на атомски погон — nuclear-powered submarine

===Interjection===
{{sh-interjection|head=на!|c|na!|na!}}

# [[here you are|Here you are!]] Take it!
# [[help yourself|Help yourself!]]

